--- Part C (item 1): boundedness/uniqueness reasoning check ---

The general solution of psi_n' - x*psi_n = source_n(x) is
   psi_n(x) = [particular solution] + A * exp(x^2/2)
for arbitrary constant A (verified: d/dx[A*exp(x^2/2)] = A*x*exp(x^2/2) 
= x * [A*exp(x^2/2)], i.e. exp(x^2/2) solves the homogeneous equation
u' = x*u exactly -- this is the y=0 case of the Growth-Exclusion Lemma's
homogeneous mode e^{x^2/2+xy} (mclust_h2_validity_attempt Sec 2.1).
Direct symbolic check: d/dx[exp(x^2/2)] - x*exp(x^2/2) = 0  PASS

